    "description": {
      "content": "The Gamesight Measurement API ingests a stream of in-game event data with device-level identifiers to power marketing attribution and measurement for PC, console, and web games. Send single events to /events or batches to /events/batch, and manage per-game do-not-track (GDPR/CCPA opt-out) state.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gamesight Support\n Email: support@gamesight.io",
